ct and identify the internal and external factors that are favorable and unfavorable to achieving those objectives. Users of a SWOT analysis often ask and answer questions to generate meaningful information for each category to make the tool useful and identify their competitive advantage. SWOT has been described as the tried-and-true tool of strategic analysis, but has also been criticized for its limitations.","box":[0.4947,0.2986,0.4042,0.5124]},{"anchor":"s3","text":"SWOT Analysis","box":[0.0283,0.0378,0.9417,0.0673]}],"warnings":[],"stats":{"objects":30,"textBlocks":15},"reconstructedSlots":[{"anchor":"text-0","text":"Internal factors that give you ","box":[0.2023802999530479,0.25313370316116895,0.19373758447484374,0.023149984854239004],"origin":[0.2023802999530479,0.27165369104456016],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":12.50100040435791,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-1","text":"an advantage","box":[0.2523995957732299,0.28090221263744214,0.08992815406393179,0.023149984854239004],"origin":[0.2523995957732299,0.29942220052083335],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":12.50100040435791,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-2","text":"Strengths","box":[0.2489444200906681,0.21612632186324507,0.06299918398071817,0.023149998982747395],"origin":[0.2489444200906681,0.23464632387514467],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":12.50100040435791,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-3","text":"S","box":[0.13907362261381118,0.24111220748336226,0.013216794420678761,0.03706111201533565],"origin":[0.13907362261381118,0.2707611083984375],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":20.01300048828125,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-4","text":"Internal factors that work to ","box":[0.2059229743918717,0.4079373960141782,0.1867840638777478,0.023149984854239004],"origin":[0.2059229743918717,0.42645738389756943],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":12.50100040435791,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-5","text":"your disadvantage","box":[0.23645392097741752,0.4357577853732639,0.